# Line-ending policy for this repo.
#
# Text files are stored and checked out as LF on every platform, regardless of
# each machine's `core.autocrlf`. The tree is already all-LF, so this changes no
# content — it just stops Git's "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on Windows
# and keeps diffs free of line-ending noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never apply line-ending conversion to these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.bmp  binary
